{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41966","headline":"献中书汤舍人 · 李中","name":"献中书汤舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庆云呈瑞爲明时，演畅丝纶在紫微。\n銮殿对时亲舜日，鲤庭过处着莱衣。\n闲寻竹寺听啼鸟，吟倚江楼恋落晖。\n隔座银屏看是设，一门清贵古今稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}